ure\n\nkeyof `TFeatures` & `string`\n\n### table\n\n[`Table_Internal`](../interfaces/Table_Internal.md)\\<`TFeatures`, `TData`\\>\n\n### apis\n\n[`APIObject`](../type-aliases/APIObject.md)\\<`TDeps`, [`NoInfer`](../type-aliases/NoInfer.md)\\<`TDepArgs`\\>\\>\n\n## Returns\n\n`void`\n"}
